Description: Read an uncached PnP ID before creating the HoG HID device
 The Device Information profile can finish after the HoG report map, so the
 kernel can receive a HID device with vendor and product both zero. Read the
 PnP ID on the HoG GATT client so its existing idle handling waits for the
 identity. Continue without it when the characteristic is absent or unreadable.
 .
 Cover the UHID identity for the uncached, absent and failed read paths.
Forwarded: no

